canvas 520 300
label "Data model: a Bundle holds items of six types (concept, episode, procedure, lesson, cluster, gate); every item is one Markdown file with a YAML header (highlighted) that carries typed links to other items, a provenance record and sources"
caption "The highlighted file shape is the same for all six types; links, provenance and sources are keys in its header."
region bundle 16 20 488 230 "Bundle: one directory, one configuration file"
box concept 28 40 72 40 "Concept"
box episode 108 40 72 40 "Episode"
box procedure 188 40 72 40 "Procedure"
box lesson 268 40 72 40 "Lesson"
box cluster 348 40 72 40 "Cluster"
box gate 428 40 72 40 "Gate"
box item 130 110 260 44 "an item: one Markdown file + YAML header" acc
box links 28 180 200 44 "14 typed links between items"
box prov 260 180 110 44 "provenance"
box src 392 180 100 44 "sources|(citations)"
arrow concept item via=64,124
arrow episode item
arrow procedure item
arrow lesson item
arrow cluster item
arrow gate item via=464,124
arrow item links
arrow item prov
arrow item src
note "six types, one file shape; everything else is a link, a source or a provenance record"
